                "text": "Thanks to the Inflation Reduction Act, we\u2019ve:\n\n\u2705 Enabled Medicare to negotiate prescription drug costs\n\u2705 \u200b\u200bCapped the cost of Insulin to $35 per month for seniors\n\u2705 Capped out-of-pocket costs for seniors on Medicare\n\nLet\u2019s build on this progress!",
